 "title": "You know how to win, Hannibal",
 "saying": "vincere scīs, Hannibal; victōriā ūtī nescīs",
 "author": "Livy",
 "work": "Ab urbe conditā",
 "citation": "Liv. 22.51.1–4",
 "setting": "The battlefield of Cannae, Apulia, August 216 BC",
